[[File:Albrekh-Forging.jpg|thumb|right|300px|The metalsmith, Albrekh, at his Sith forge.]]
A '''metalsmith''',<ref name="TROS Junior Novel">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: A Junior Novel]]''</ref> also known as a '''blacksmith''',<ref name="Shadow of the Sith">''[[Shadow of the Sith]]''</ref> was a craftsperson who worked with metal, notably using a forge to heat it. [[Albrekh]] was a [[Symeong]] metalsmith who also [[Sith alchemist|practiced]] [[Sith alchemy]].<ref name="TROS Junior Novel" />

